  "Id": "a5e30eab-98f2-543f-9d82-d04d04b001df"/*VolumeNanoVdbSmokeExample*/,
  "Description": "Billowing smoke rendered from a NanoVDB level set.\n\nA sphere is displaced by animated [VolumeNoise]. [NanoVdbRender] uses the depth below the surface of the grid as smoke density, broken up by procedural noise. Liquid and fire are switched off.\n\nAKA: cloud, fog, density volume\n\nTips\n- SmokeSoftness sets over what depth the smoke fades in; NoiseAmount sets how ragged it looks.",
